# Template attributes

Put the opening tag on one line when it has 1–3 attributes and the line is at most 100 characters.

With 4 or more attributes, put each attribute on its own line.

Keep a tag multiline when an attribute value itself spans multiple lines.

```vue
<LinkFavicon :domain="link.url" variant="overlay" />

<Button variant="overlay" size="sm" aria-label="Открыть настройки">
  Save
</Button>

<a
  v-for="link in links"
  :key="link.url"
  :href="link.url"
  class="block"
>
  {{ link.title }}
</a>
```

```vue
<!-- ❌ three attributes that fit on one line -->
<LinkFavicon
  :domain="link.url"
  variant="overlay"
/>
```
